<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>Start with the denial letter: identify the exact reason and the policy language cited. Every next step depends on it.</li>
<li>Check NOAA storm records for your date of loss. Major events like April 21, 2023 and May 8, 2025 are documented for McAllen and nearby areas.</li>
